{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/\u0441\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0430_5__1_.gif?t=1748446149\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a hypnotist whose name is all over 1930s Germany. You can do anything:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">read minds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">cast characters into a trance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">impersonate others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">know the precise time of death of everyone including yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/mmartinn77.gif?t=1748446149\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/leona_1.gif?t=1748446149\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds hella nice, doesn\u2019t it? Now imagine - one of your experiments goes awry and you swap fates. Which means:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re stuck with some alcoholic\u2019s memories permanently in your mind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">nightmares haunt you\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you\u2019re a crime accomplice\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but most importantly: you only have five hours to live</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/mmomm_1.gif?t=1748446149\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you unravel the mysteries of the past without going insane and turn back time? <br>The countdown\u2019s on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Hypnosis as a core mechanic: explore and reshape other people's memories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Interactive dialogues with consequences and nonlinear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Psychological puzzles based on logic and emotional insight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Read characters' thoughts to uncover inner conflicts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Atmosphere of paranoia, guilt, and fear \u2014 no jump scares</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Free exploration: choose your own order of scenes and conversations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Historical setting: Germany on the brink of dictatorship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/43545543.png?t=1748446149\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3140780?t=1748446149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3140780?t=1748446149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/685e0ad2c1805ee95f74cd48345a5ee7f65362d7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748446149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/685e0ad2c1805ee95f74cd48345a5ee7f65362d7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748446149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140780/extras/\u0441\u0446\u0435\u043d\u0430_5__1_.gif?t=1748446149\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a hypnotist whose name is all over 1